{"steam_appid":1887730,"steam_name":"Valley of the Dead: MalnaZidos","trailer_hls":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/1887730/442653/0d82097e71da993c415363f267b9e7fc95ac4695/1751043972/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1645779995","trailer_thumb":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/256875377/movie.293x165.jpg?t=1645779995","screenshots":["https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1887730/ss_f41cdefd1fbd8fa3dd07c8e9adba87bb314c26fc.1920x1080.jpg?t=1698954922","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1887730/ss_c8f89d96c8a00d34702ffce92c0d20242a3673e2.1920x1080.jpg?t=1698954922","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1887730/ss_1334f838da09c0b928e061884e09b83ba5758d94.1920x1080.jpg?t=1698954922","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1887730/ss_5356d69687f416acede23e6fd0f20f33ed553b91.1920x1080.jpg?t=1698954922","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1887730/ss_bb308433c0914f72f7adb1e1766c461635bc9da4.1920x1080.jpg?t=1698954922"],"about_the_game":"<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1887730/extras/5d67dcebcaa24a73b90443e7c986be77.avif?t=1698954922\" width=600 height=181 /></span><br><br>If you like horror and survival games, MalnaZidos, set during the Spanish Civil War, puts us in the shoes of characters from both sides, who will have to put aside their differences and join forces to survive a zombie pandemic.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1887730/extras/155044ca3d44e10c974e8ec0aac9773c.poster.avif?t=1698954922\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1887730/extras/155044ca3d44e10c974e8ec0aac9773c.webm?t=1698954922\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1887730/extras/155044ca3d44e10c974e8ec0aac9773c.mp4?t=1698954922\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1887730/extras/5c8c1f0383b20259335fff8d596d30bd.avif?t=1698954922\" width=600 height=132 /></span><br><br>Daring mix between a survival game, stealth and shooter, full of action with a story told in 2D visual novel format with a careful and spectacular finish.<br><br>An incredible adventure through open levels, forests, dark dungeons and abandoned villages with Jan, Matacuras, De Cruz, Mecha, Rafir, Brodsky and Sor Flor as protagonists, do you dare?<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1887730/extras/2f1de38e0ddaf17087a3bf919803b019.poster.avif?t=1698954922\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1887730/extras/2f1de38e0ddaf17087a3bf919803b019.webm?t=1698954922\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1887730/extras/2f1de38e0ddaf17087a3bf919803b019.mp4?t=1698954922\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1887730/extras/1d6191a090687809e791d12295cccf2a.avif?t=1698954922\" width=600 height=121 /></span><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Third person shooter.<br></li><li>Stealth and survival mechanics.<br></li><li>7 playable characters with unique mechanics.<br></li><li>Many zombies, few bullets.<br></li><li>Variety of scenarios, full of secrets.<br></li><li>Cell-Shading graphic style, imitating the comic style.<br></li><li>Story told as a graphic novel.</li></ul><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1887730/extras/181eeae4d868f5e56a4b64925866ac28.poster.avif?t=1698954922\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1887730/extras/181eeae4d868f5e56a4b64925866ac28.webm?t=1698954922\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1887730/extras/181eeae4d868f5e56a4b64925866ac28.mp4?t=1698954922\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>","requirements_minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS *:</strong> Windows 7 SP1 64bit, Windows 8.1 64bit<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i3-2100 / AMD® FX-6300<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 MB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA® GeForce GTX 750 Ti / ATI Radeon HD 7950<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 9.0c<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 4 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>Sound Card:</strong> DirectX 9 sound device<br></li><li><strong>Additional Notes:</strong> Controller support: Microsoft Xbox ® Controller for Windows®</li></ul>","requirements_recommended":"","genres":["Action","Adventure"],"developers":["Gammera Nest"],"publishers":["Gammera Nest"],"release_date":"11 Mar, 2022"}